Z||000006||Monkeyman||07-07-2001||04:14 AM||||The fuel pump in my last Fiero ('85 GT w/ 75k miles) was noisier than heck but it ran well (no problems were related to the fuel pump.  On the other hand, the fuel pump in 4Play is whisper quiet but I just found out yesterday that it's about to go and needs to be replaced (there goes another 300 bucks).  I wouldn't worry too much about the volume until something happens.  Hopefully, it will give you (or your wife) some notice before heading south.<P>------------------<BR>'Consciousness:  That annoying time between naps.'<P>MM||||reg||1
